#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
#: buildVars.py:21
msgid "Studio Recorder"
msgstr "Studio Recorder"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid ""
"Adds braille support to Studio Recorder.\n"
"Also a few additional keystrokes are implemented\n"
"to ease common tasks which do not have shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"Fügt Braille-Unterstützung hinzu.\n"
"Ebenso werden einige zusätzliche Tastenkombinationen eingeführt,\n"
"um die tägliche Arbeit mit Studio Recorder zu vereinfachen."

